msgstr "Akukho Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Ukuze kuphetshwe iziphumo zokufiphalisa ezibangelwa yi-anti-aliasing, i-RRDtool itsalela amanqaku kwiiphikseli zesisombululo sesixhobo, oku kubangela inkangeleko ecacileyo. Ukuba oku akukuthandi, ungasebenzisa esi switshi ukucima oku kuziphatha.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>I-Gridfitting icinyiwe kwimveliso ye-PDF, EPS, SVG ngokungagqibekanga."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Igridi Enye ka-Y (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "I-algorithim iqinisekisa ukuba uhlala unegridi, ukuba kukho imigca yegridi eyaneleyo kodwa engabi mininzi kakhulu, kwaye igridi iyimetrikhi. Le pharamitha iya kuqinisekisa kwakhona ukuba ufumana amanani edesimali aneleyo aboniswayo nokuba igrafu yakho isuka ku-69.998 ukuya ku-70.001.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Le pharamitha inokuphazamisana neenketho ze--alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Iinketho Ze-asi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "I-asi Yasekunene (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "I-asi yesibini iya kuzotywa ngasekunene kwegrafu. Idityaniswe ne-asi yasekhohlo ngeepharamitha ze-scale ne-shift."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Ilebhile Ye-asi Yasekunene (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Ilebhile ye-asi yasekunene."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Ifomathi Ye-asi Yasekunene (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga, ifomathi yeelebheli ze-eksisi imiselwa ngokuzenzekelayo. Ukuba ufuna ukuzenzela oku ngokwakho, sebenzisa olu khetho kunye ii-arguments ezifanayo ze-%lf ozaziyo kwimiyalelo ye-PRINT kunye ne-GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Isifomathi se-Eksisi yaseKunene (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Xa useta iilebheli ze-eksisi yasekunene, sebenzisa umgaqo kwifomathi yedatha. Iifomathi ezixhaswayo ziquka i-\"numeric\" apho idatha iphathwa njengamanani, i-\"timestamp\" apho amaxabiso atolikwa njengezibonisi-xesha ze-UNIX (inani lemizuzwana ukususela ngoJanyuwari 1970) kwaye achazwa kusetyenziswa ifomathi ye-strftime (okungagqibekanga ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Jonga kwakhona ku --units-length naku --right-axis-format. Ekugqibeleni i-\"duration\" apho amaxabiso atolikwa njengobude bexesha ngeemilisekondi. Ukufomatha kulandela imigaqo ye-PRINT/GPRINT eqinisekiswe nge-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Isifomathi se-Eksisi yaseKhohlo (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Xa useta iilebheli ze-eksisi yasekhohlo, sebenzisa umgaqo kwifomathi yedatha. Iifomathi ezixhaswayo ziquka i-\"numeric\" apho idatha iphathwa njengamanani, i-\"timestamp\" apho amaxabiso atolikwa njengezibonisi-xesha ze-UNIX (inani lemizuzwana ukususela ngoJanyuwari 1970) kwaye achazwa kusetyenziswa ifomathi ye-strftime (okungagqibekanga ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Jonga kwakhona ku --units-length. Ekugqibeleni i-\"duration\" apho amaxabiso atolikwa njengobude bexesha ngeemilisekondi. Ukufomatha kulandela imigaqo ye-PRINT/GPRINT eqinisekiswe nge-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Ukhetho lweLejendi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Ukongeza iZithuba ngokuZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Yongeza izithuba kwiteksti ukuze ilejendi nedatha yegrafu zihlale zilungelelene. Qaphela: oku kunokubangela ukuba iigrafu zithathe ixesha elide ukuzotywa ngenxa yomthwalo omkhulu wokusebenza. Kwakhona Ukongeza iZithuba ngokuZenzekelayo kunokungachaneki kuzo zonke iintlobo zeegrafu, ukulebhela okungaguqukiyo kudla ngokunceda."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Iilebheli eziGuquguqukayo (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Zoba iimpawu zomgca njengomgca."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Nyanzela iLejendi yeMigaqo (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Nyanzela ukuveliswa kweelejendi ze-HRULE kunye ne-VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Ububanzi beThebhu (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga ububanzi bethebhu zii-pixels ezingama-40, sebenzisa olu khetho ukubutshintsha."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Indawo yeLejendi (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

