#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Vavanya iMithombo yeDatha"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Phawula le bhokisi yokutshekisha ukuba ufuna ukuvavanya iMithombo yeDatha phambi kokuba yenziwe. Xa ukuVavanya iMithombo yeDatha kuvuliwe, ukuba uMthombo weDatha awubuyisi datha esebenzayo, iGrafu ayiyi kwenziwa. Olu seto lubalulekile ukuba ufuna ukuba neThempleyithi yeSixhobo eqhelekileyo enokubandakanya iiThempleyithi zeGrafu ezingakumbi ezinokusetyenziswa ngokukhetha ngokuxhomekeke kwiimpawu zeSixhobo ngokwaso. Qaphela: Ukuba unesikripthi esithatha ixesha elide njengoMthombo weDatha, ixesha lokwenza iiGrafu liya kunyuka."

