msgstr "Uluhlu olwahlulwe ngekoma lwee-ID zeZixhobo onqwenela ukuba zibe kwimowudi ye-Debug ngexesha lokuqokelelwa kwedatha. Eli nqanaba le-Debug lisebenza kuphela ngexesha lenkqubo ye-polling ye-Cacti."

