msgstr "Inkxaso yoLwimi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose 'enabled' to allow the localization of Cacti. The strict mode requires that the requested language will also be supported by all plugins being installed at your system. If that's not the fact everything will be displayed in English."
msgstr "Khetha u-'enabled' ukuvumela ukwenziwa kwe-Cacti ngolwimi lwasekuhlaleni. Imowudi engqongqo ifuna ukuba ulwimi oluceliweyo luxhaswe nayizo zonke iiplagi ezifakelweyo kwinkqubo yakho. Ukuba akunjalo, yonke into iya kuboniswa ngesiNgesi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Ulwimi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default language for this system."
msgstr "Ulwimi olusisiseko lwale nkqubo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Language Detection"
msgstr "Ukufumanisa uLwimi ngokuZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow to automatically determine the 'default' language of the user and provide it at login time if that language is supported by Cacti. If disabled, the default language will be in force until the user elects another language."
msgstr "Vumela ukufumanisa ngokuzenzekelayo ulwimi 'olusisiseko' lomsebenzisi uze ulunike ngexesha lokungena ukuba olo lwimi luxhaswa yi-Cacti. Ukuba lukhubaziwe, ulwimi olusisiseko luya kusebenza de umsebenzisi akhethe olunye ulwimi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Preferred Language Processor"
msgstr "Isiqhubi soLwimi eSikhethiweyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
