msgstr "Uguqulelo lwe-RRDtool olufakileyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Gradient Support"
msgstr "Vula iNkxaso ye-Gradient"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enabled Gradient Support for AREA and STACK charts."
msgstr "Inkxaso ye-Gradient evuliweyo kwiitshathi ze-AREA kunye ne-STACK."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yemvume Yegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Kukho iindlela ezine zokumisela iimvume zegrafu zomsebenzisi. Eyokuqala yi-'Evumelayo'. Phantsi kwesethingi 'Evumelayo', umsebenzisi ufuna kuphela ukufikelela kwigrafu, isixhobo okanye itempleyithi yegrafu ukuze afikelele kwiigrafu ezisebenza kuye. Phantsi kwe-'Ethintelayo', umsebenzisi kufuneka abe nokufikelela kwigrafu, isixhobo, kunye netempleyithi yegrafu ukuze afikelele kwigrafu. Ezi ndlela zimbini zokuqala zineengxaki zokwandiseka kufakelo olukhulu kakhulu. Ngoko ke, kukho iinketho ezimbini ezongezelelweyo. Zezi 'Esekelwe Kwisixhobo', nto leyo ethetha ukuba ukuba unokufikelela kwisixhobo, ufumana ukufikelela kwiigrafu zaso. Kwaye okokugqibela 'Esekelwe Kwitempleyithi Yegrafu', nto leyo ethetha ukuba ukuba unokufikelela kwi-'Itempleyithi Yegrafu' ufumana ukufikelela kuzo zonke iigrafu zesixhobo zaloo templeyithi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Evumelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Ethintelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Esekelwe Kwisixhobo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yokuyila Igrafu/Umthombo Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Ukuba isetelwe ku-Elula, iigrafu kunye nemithombo yedatha zinokuyilwa kuphela ukusuka kwiigrafu ezintsha. Ukuba ngu-Ehambele phambili, ukuyilwa kwegrafu nomthombo wedatha wakudala kuyaxhaswa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Elula"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Ehambele phambili"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Bonisa Uncedo Lwefom/Lwesethingi Ngaphakathi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Xa ikhangelwe, uncedo lwefom nolwesethingi luya kuboniswa ngaphakathi. Kungenjalo luya kuboniswa xa uhambisa imouse phezu kweqhosha loncedo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Uncedo Lwephepha Lwasekhaya Kuphela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga uncedo lwephepha lwe-Cacti lufumaneka ku-docs.cacti.net. Nangona kunjalo, ukuba inkqubo yakho ayinakufikelela kwi-Intanethi, ungakhuphela amaxwebhu ekuhlaleni ngefomathi ye-HTML uze uwagcine kwindawo ye-'docs' yeseva yakho ye-Cacti. Ukuba ukhetha ukusebenzisa indawo yasekhaya kuphela kumaxwebhu oncedo lwephepha, khangela le bhokisi yokutshekisha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Ukuqinisekiswa Kokucima"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Buza umsebenzisi phambi kokucima into."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Useto Lwangaphambili Lokugcinwa Komthombo Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Xa yenziwe yasebenza, i-Cacti iya kuseta iqhosha lerediyo ukuba licime imithombo yedatha enxulumeneyo yegrafu xa kushenxiswa iigrafu. Qaphela: I-Cacti ayizukuvumela ukushenxiswa kwemithombo yedatha ukuba isetyenziswa kwezinye iigrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Ukuvula Ngokuzenzekelayo Kweegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Xa yenziwe yasebenza, i-Cacti ayizukutshixa iigrafu. Oku kuvumela ukuguqulwa ngokukhawuleza ngesandla kwemithombo yedatha enxulumene negrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Fihla Ideshibhodi Ye-Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Ukusetyenziswa kunye neNkxaso yeKhonkco laNgaphandle ye-Cacti. Ngokusebenzisa le sethingi, unokufihla ideshibhodi ye-Cacti, ukuze ubonise iphepha lakho kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Vumela Ukutsala Nokulahla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Eminye imijelo ye-Cacti iyaxhasa Ukutsala Nokulahla. Ukuba ikhangelwe le nketho iya kwenziwa isebenze. Qaphela: Kubasebenzisi abangaboniyo kakuhle, le nketho inokuvalwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Ukhuseleko Lwesayithi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Nyanzela Unxibelelwano nge-HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Xa ikhangelwe, naziphi na iinzame zokufikelela kwi-Cacti ziya kuthunyelwa kwi-HTTPS ukuqinisekisa ukhuseleko oluphezulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Vumela i-HTTPS engakhuselekanga yomqokeleli wedatha okude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Vumela ukusetyenziswa kwezatifiketi ezizisayinelweyo kwaye uvumele igama le-host lesatifiketi ukuba lahluke kwelo lomqokeleli wedatha okude."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Vumela ii-metacharacters ezingakhuselekanga kwiindlela zokufaka idatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Ngokwembali, abalawuli be-Cacti badala iindlela zokufaka idatha ezilula ezibandakanya imiyalelo efana no-\"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" ukumela ixabiso lenani lokusetyenziswa kwiigrafu ze-Cacti. Kwiinguqulelo zangaphambili ze-Cacti, oku kwakuvunyelwe. Nangona kunjalo, le yinkqubo engakhuselekanga njengoko isisisango sokuba abasebenzisi beqela lesithathu bapapashe iitempleyithi zedatha ezingakhuselekanga. Kwi-Cacti yanamhlanje, ezi ntlobo zeenkqubo kufuneka ziphetshwe. Nangona kunjalo, sinika olu khetho ukuba uneendlela zokufaka idatha ezindala eziqulethe ezi Meta Characters zingakhuselekanga kwaye ungaziguqulelanga kwizikripthi zengingqi kuvimba weefayile othi 'scripts'. Xa olu khetho lungakhethwanga, i-Cacti ithintela ii-metacharacters zohlobo lwe-shell ezinjengophawu locaphulo, iibhrakhethi ezigobileyo, imivalo ethe nkqo, ii-backslash, kunye nee-backtick. I-Cacti iyaqhubeka nokuvumela iimpawu zokugqitha nokuba ngaphantsi kwizinto ezifana ne-<path_cacti> kunye neeparamitha zegalelo, kodwa ukuba olu khetho lungakhethwanga, lowo ngumda wokusetyenziswa kwazo okuvunyelweyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Umgaqo-nkqubo wesikripthi wokhuseleko lomxholo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Ilawula umgaqo-nkqubo we-CSP we-script-src. Kwiimowudi ze-Nonce, iiplagini ze-Cacti ezisebenzisa i-JavaScript engaphakathi kufuneka zibandakanye uphawu lwe-nonce oluvela kumsebenzi owakhelwe ngaphakathi we-Cacti othi 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Kungenjalo, ezo zikripthi ziya kuvalwa sisikhangeli. Okwangoku, i-Cacti ivumela kuphela ukunika ingxelo ngeeplagini ze-Cacti ezingayisebenzisiyo ngokufanelekileyo iMowudi ye-Nonce. Kwixesha elizayo, siya kuvumela abalawuli ukuba bavale ezo plagini ekusebenziseni i-JavaScript yazo engaphakathi ukuba azisebenzisi ii-Nonce."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Vumela i-JavaScript engaphakathi engenayo i-Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Vumela zombini i-unsafe-eval kunye ne-JavaScript engaphakathi engenayo i-Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Imowudi ye-Nonce - Ukunika ingxelo kuphela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "I-URI Yengxelo Yokwaphulwa kwe-CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "I-URL apho izikhangeli zithumela ngayo nge-POST iingxelo zolwaphulo lwe-CSP kwiimowudi ze-nonce-report kunye ne-nonce. Shiya kungenanto ukusebenzisa i-<url_path>/csp_report.php. Kufuneka iqulathe oonobumba be-URL abakhuselekileyo kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Imithombo Eyenye ye-Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Amagama edomeyini ahlulwe ngezithuba aya kuvunyelwa ukuba afikelelwe ngaphandle kweSeva yeWebhu ngokwayo. Oku kubalulekile kubasebenzisi abakhetha ukusebenzisa i-CDN, okanye isayithi yokusingatha. Imithombo ingaquka ii-wildcard umzekelo: *.mydomain.com, okanye iprothokholi, umzekelo: https://*.example.com. Le Mithombo eNye iquka iintlobo zeMifanekiso, i-CSS kunye ne-JavaScript kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "I-URL apho iibhrawuza zithumela khona nge-POST iingxelo zolwaphulo lwe-CSP kwiimowudi ze-nonce-report ne-nonce. Shiya ingenanto ukuze usebenzise i-/cacti/csp_report.php kwingcambu yofakelo. Kufuneka iqulethe oonobumba be-URL abakhuselekileyo kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Vumela ukuYilwa kweeGrafu ngokuZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Xa ikhubaziwe, uZenzekelayo lwe-Cacti aluyi kuyila nayiphi na iGrafu ngokusebenzayo.  Oku kuluncedo xa uhlengahlengisa iisethingi zeSixhobo ukuze uphephe ukuyila iiGrafu ezintsha ngalo lonke ixesha ugcina into.  Ukubiza iMithetho yoZenzekelayo ngesandla kuya kuhlala kunokwenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Vumela ukuYilwa kweeNto zoMthi ngokuZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Xa ikhubaziwe, uZenzekelayo lwe-Cacti aluyi kuyila nayiphi na iNto yoMthi ngokusebenzayo.  Oku kuluncedo xa uhlengahlengisa iisethingi zeSixhobo okanye zeGrafu ukuze uphephe ukuyila iiNgeniso zoMthi ezintsha ngalo lonke ixesha ugcina into.  Ukubiza iMithetho ngesandla kuya kuhlala kunokwenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "I-imeyile Yomamkeli Yesaziso soZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Idilesi ye-imeyile yokuthumela kuyo ii-imeyile zeSaziso soZenzekelayo ukuba ayikhankanywanga kwinqanaba leNethiwekhi yoZenzekelayo.  Ukuba eli candelo, okanye ixabiso leNethiwekhi yoZenzekelayo lishiywe lingenanto, i-Cacti iya kusebenzisa i-akhawunti ye-imeyile yabaPhathi abaPhambili be-Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Igama Lomthumeli Lesaziso soZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Igama le-imeyile elisetyenziselwa ii-imeyile zeSaziso soZenzekelayo ukuba alikhankanywanga kwinqanaba leNethiwekhi yoZenzekelayo.  Ukuba eli candelo, okanye ixabiso leNethiwekhi yoZenzekelayo lishiywe lingenanto, i-Cacti iya kusebenzisa iGama Lomthumeli elingagqibekanga lenkqubo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "I-imeyile Yomthumeli Yesaziso soZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Idilesi Ye-imeyile emayisetyenziselwe Ii-imeyile Zesaziso Sokuzenzekela ukuba ayichazwanga kwinqanaba Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela. Ukuba eli candelo, okanye ixabiso Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela lishiywe lingenanto, i-Cacti iya kusebenzisa Idilesi Ye-imeyile Yomthumeli emiselweyo yesistim."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Okumiselweyo Kwethempleyithi Yegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Umthombo Wedatha Wovavanyo Lwethempleyithi Yegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Beka uphawu kule bhokisi yokukhetha ukuba ufuna ukuvavanya Imithombo Yedatha phambi kokuyidalwa kwazo kwiiThempleyithi Zegrafu ezintsha nezisandula ukungeniswa. Xa Uvavanyo Lwemithombo Yedatha luvuliwe, ukuba Umthombo Wedatha awubuyiseli datha isebenzayo, Igrafu ayiyi kuyilwa. Esi setingi sibalulekile ukuba ufuna ukuba neThempleyithi Yesixhobo eqhelekileyo engabandakanya Iithempleyithi Zegrafu ezingaphezulu ezinokusetyenziswa ngokukhetha ngokuxhomekeke kwiimpawu zeSixhobo ngokwaso. Qaphela: Ukuba unesikripthi esithatha ixesha elide njengoMthombo Wedatha, ixesha lokuyila Iigrafu liya kwanda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ifomathi Yomfanekiso emiselweyo emayisetyenziswe kuzo zonke Iithempleyithi Zegrafu ezintsha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Height to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ubude Begrafu obumiselweyo obumabusetyenziswe kuzo zonke Iithempleyithi Zegrafu ezintsha."

