msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Ixesha eliphela ngalo iiyure zakho zoshishino. Ifomathi: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Weekends"
msgstr "Fihla iiMpela-veki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only show business hours during weekdays."
msgstr "Bonisa kuphela iiyure zoshishino ngeentsuku zeveki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show business hours"
msgstr "Bonisa iiyure zoshishino"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Display business hours on rrd graphs."
msgstr "Bonisa iiyure zoshishino kwiigrafu ze-rrd."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Umbala oza kusetyenziselwa iiyure zoshishino"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Umbala oza kuboniswa kwiiyure zoshishino"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Elona nani likhulu leentsuku zokubonisa iiyure zoshishino"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Emva kweli nani leentsuku, iiyure zoshishino azisayi kongezwa kwigrafu. <br/>Okucetyiswayo: iintsuku ezingama-62"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "UkuQokelelwa kweDatha kuVunyelwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Ukuba ufuna ukuyeka ngokupheleleyo inkqubo ye-polling, susa uphawu kule bhokisi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-poller oluza kusetyenziswa.  Olu seto luya kusebenza kwisithuba esilandelayo se-polling."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Isithuba soNgqamaniso lwe-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Isithuba esisisiseko songqamaniso lwe-polling esiza kusetyenziswa xa kusenziwa i-poller.  Olu seto luya kuchaphazela ukuba ii-poller ezikude zihlolwa kwaye zihlaziywa kangaphi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Isithuba se-polling esisetyenziswayo.  Olu seto luya kuchaphazela ukuba ii-RRDfiles zihlolwa kwaye zihlaziywa kangaphi.  <strong><u>QAPHELA: Ukuba utshintsha eli xabiso, kufuneka uphinde ugcwalise i-poller cache.  Ukungaphumeleli ukwenza oko, kunokukhokelela ekulahlekeni kwedatha.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Isithuba se-Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ukufuthi okuya kuqaliswa ngako umqokeleli wedatha we-Cacti.  Ungasebenzisa nokuba yi-crontab, umsebenzi ocwangcisiweyo (kwi-windows), okanye inkonzo ye-systemd ye-cactid ukulawula ukuqaliswa komqokeleli wedatha we-Cacti.  Ngemiyalelo yokusebenzisa i-daemon ye-cactid, jonga ifayile ye-README.md kuvimba wenkonzo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Linganisa uMthwalo weNkqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Ukuba ukhetha olu khetho, i-Cacti iya kuzama ukulinganisa umthwalo wenkqubo nganye ye-poller ngokwaba ngokulinganayo imiba ye-poller kwinkqubo nganye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ububanzi beMveliso ye-Debug"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Ukuba ukhetha olu khetho, i-Cacti iya kukhangela imveliso edlula amandla e-Cacti okuyigcina kwaye ikhuphe isilumkiso xa iyifumana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuPhelelwa le-Arhente eKude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Ixesha, ngemizuzwana, eliya kulindwa yiseva yewebhu enguMbindi ye-Cacti ukufumana impendulo kuMqokeleli weDatha oKude ukuze ifumane ulwazi olwahlukeneyo lweSixhobo phambi kokuba ishiye isicelo.  KwiZixhobo ezinxulunyaniswe naBaqokeleli beDatha abahlukileyo kuMqokeleli weDatha onguMbindi we-Cacti, uMenzeli oKude kufuneka asetyenziswe ukuqokelela ulwazi lweSixhobo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Hlaziya iTheyibhile ye-Poller ngoMjikelo ngaMnye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Olu seto lwenzelwe iinkqubo ze-poller enye kuphela ukuze kwakhiwe kwakhona itheyibhile yemveliso ye-poller kumjikelo ngamnye we-polling ukunqanda itheyibhile yememori ekusebenziseni i-swap kwiinkqubo ezinkulu kakhulu ezineedatabase ezinkulu ezinokusebenzisa i-swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Khubaza uPhindaphindo lwe-Resource Cache"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga, Umqokeleli Wedatha oyintloko we-Cacti uya kugcina yonke iwebhusayithi kunye neeplagini kwi-Resource Cache. Emva koko, ngamaxesha athile Abaqokeleli Bedatha Abakude baya kuzihlaziya ngalo naluphi na uhlaziyo oluvela kuMqokeleli Wedatha oyintloko we-Cacti. Le Resource Cache ivumela Abaqokeleli Bedatha Abakude ukuba baziphucule ngokwabo. Ukuba awufuni ukusebenzisa olu khetho, ungalukhubaza usebenzisa le setingi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Ukuziphatha kwe-SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Inkxaso Ye-arhente ye-SNMP Ivuliwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Ukuba olu khetho lukhethiwe, i-Cacti iya kuzalisa iitheyibhile ze-Arhente ye-SNMP ngolwazi lwesixhobo nolwesistim lwe-Cacti. Ayivuli I-arhente ye-SNMP ngokwayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Vula i-MD5 ne-DES kwi-SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Ii-algorithms zoqinisekiso ze-MD5 nezabucala ze-DES zezakudala, zibuthathaka, kwaye azifumaneki kwii-builds ze-PHP ne-Net-SNMP eziqinisiweyo (FIPS). Xa zivaliwe, i-MD5 ne-DES ziyasuswa kuluhlu olwehlayo lweProthokholi Yoqinisekiso neYabucala ye-SNMPv3 oluboniswa xa kuhlelwa Isixhobo nakwiinketho ze-SNMP Zokuzenzekela, kushiywa kuphela ii-algorithms ezomeleleyo ze-SHA ne-AES."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Vula I-cache Yeziqinisekiso"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Qinisa kwangaphambili uze ugcine kwi-cache iipharamitha zeziqinisekiso ze-SNMPv3 kube kanye kutshintsho ngalunye lwesiqinisekiso ukuze inkqubo nganye ye-poller iphinde izisebenzise endaweni yokuzakha kwakhona kwisicelo ngasinye. Oku kunika ukonga okuncinci xa kuqokelelwa ngeziqinisekiso ze-SNMPv3 ngee-binary ze-Net-SNMP. I-extension ye-php-snmp iphatha uninzi lwezicelo ze-get ze-SNMPv3 ngaphakathi kwenkqubo kwaye iyayitsiba le cache, kodwa ii-binary ze-Net-SNMP (ngoko ke nale cache) zisasetyenziselwa ii-SNMP walk, iziphumo ze-hex, izicelo ezimisela umxholo okanye i-engine id, kunye nemidibaniso yeeprothokholi engaxhaswayo luguqulelo lwe-PHP olusebenzayo. Vula oku ukuba uqokelela nayiphi na kule misebenzi ngeziqinisekiso ze-SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "UMda we-OID we-SNMP Get"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Inani eliphezulu elimiselweyo lee-OID ze-SNMP Get ezikhutshwayo ngesicelo ngasinye se-snmpget. Kwizixhobo, esi setingi silawulwa kwinqanaba leSixhobo. Kufuneka usebenzise esi setingi kuphela xa usebenzisa i-SNMP API ye-Cacti ngokwendalo kwizikripthi okanye kwii-plugin zakho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Ubungakanani boKulanda be-SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Zingaphi ii-OID ezifanele ukubuyiswa kwisicelo ngasinye se-snmpbulkwalk? Kwizixhobo ezinemithi emikhulu ye-SNMP, ukwandisa obu bukhulu kuya kwandisa ukusebenza kokuhlaziya i-index kwi-WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Khubaza uKujonga ukwanda kwe-OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Ilawula ukukhubaza ukujongwa kokwanda kwe-OID ngexesha lokuhamba kumthi we-OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi Ezongezelelweyo Zomqokeleli Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Ukurekhodwa Kwedatha Engamkelekanga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ungathanda ukuba iimpazamo zesiphumo soMqokeleli Wedatha zirekhodwe njani? Iinketho ziquka: 'Okuneenkcukacha' okuchaza impazamo nganye ngokweenkcukacha, 'Isishwankathelo' esinika inani leempazamo zesiphumo ngeSixhobo ngasinye, kunye 'Akukho nanye', engeniki manani eempazamo."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Isishwankathelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Okuneenkcukacha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Inani Leeseva Zezikripthi Ze-PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Inani leenkqubo zeseva yezikripthi ezisebenza ngaxeshanye kwinkqubo nganye ye-spine. Iisetingi eziphakathi kwe-1 ne-15 zamkelekile. Le pharamitha iya kunceda ukuba usebenzisa imitya emininzi kunye nezikripthi zeseva yezikripthi kwaye isebenza kuphela kuMqokeleli Wedatha we-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Ixabiso Lomda Wexesha Lesikripthi Neseva Yesikripthi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide eliya kulindwa yi-spine ukuze iskripthi sigqitywe. Eli xabiso lexesha lokuphela likwimizuzwana kwaye lisebenza kuMqokeleli weDatha we-spine kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Ukwenziwa Kwe-indeksi Kwakhona Kwezixhobo Zonke Ngamaxesha Athile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Ishedyuli Yokwenza I-indeksi Kwakhona Kwezixhobo Zonke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Ngawuphi umjikelo ofuna ukwenza i-indeksi kwakhona kuzo zonke Izixhobo. Oku kwenza i-indeksi kwakhona kuya kwenzeka ezinzulwini zobusuku ngokwezinga olikhethayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Ngeveki ngeCawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Ngenyanga ngeCawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi zeXesha lokuPhela elingaseMva neeNkqubo eziQhutywa ngaXeshanye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuPhela lokuVelisa iNgxelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi sokuVelisa iiNgxelo se-Cacti esinokusebenza ngaphandle kokwenza imposiso yexesha lokuphela kwaye sipheliswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s Umzuzu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Umda Wexesha Wezibalo Zomthombo Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi seZibalo Zomthombo Wedatha se-Cacti sinokusebenza ngalo ngaphandle kokuvelisa impazamo yokuphela kwexesha kwaye sipheliswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Umda Wexesha We-RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi sokujonga i-RRDfile se-Cacti esinokusebenza ngaphandle kokwenza imposiso yexesha lokuphela kwaye sipheliswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s Iyure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Umda Wexesha Wemiyalelo Ye-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi se-Background Commands se-Cacti sinokusebenza ngalo ngaphandle kokuvelisa impazamo yokuphela kwexesha kwaye sipheliswe. Esi skripthi siya kwenza imisebenzi efana nokwenza i-indeksi kwakhona kweZixhobo nokucoca izixhobo kubaqokeleli bedatha abakude."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Iinkqubo Zomiyalelo Ye-Poller Ezisebenza Ngaxeshanye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Inani leenkqubo zoMiyalelo ye-Poller ezisebenza ngaxeshanye. Kuya kubakho umyalelo omnye kuphela osebenza ngaxeshanye ngexesha kwi-host nganye ngaphakathi kwiqela loMiyalelo ye-Poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Inkqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d Iinkqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Umda Wexesha Wokwenziwa Kolondolozo Ngasemva"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi soLondolozo se-Cacti sinokusebenza ngalo ngaphandle kokuvelisa impazamo yokuphela kwexesha kwaye sipheliswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Umda Wexesha Wokwenziwa Kwe-Spikekill Ngasemva"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi se-Spikekill se-Cacti sinokusebenza ngalo ngaphandle kokuvelisa impazamo yokuphela kwexesha kwaye sipheliswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Okumiselweyo koMqokeleli weDatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Ezi setingi zigcinwa kwinqanaba loMqokeleli weDatha. Amaxabiso apha ngawokumiselweyo kuphela asetyenziswayo xa kuqala ukwenziwa uMqokeleli weDatha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Iinkqubo zoMqokeleli weDatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Inani elimiselweyo leenkqubo eziqhutywa ngaxeshanye kuMqokeleli weDatha ngamnye. QAPHELA: Ukuqala kwi-Cacti 1.2, le setingi igcinwa kuMqokeleli weDatha. Ukuya phambili, eli xabiso lisisetingi sangaphambili kuphela soMqokeleli weDatha. Ukusebenzisa inani eliphezulu xa usebenzisa i-cmd.php kuya kuphucula ukusebenza. Uphuculo lokusebenza kwi-Spine lulungiswa kakuhle ngeparamitha ye-threads. Xa usebenzisa i-Spine, sicebisa inani eliphantsi kwaye usebenzise ii-threads endaweni yoko. Xa usebenzisa i-cmd.php, ungasebenzisi ngaphezu kwe-2x yenani leenkozo ze-CPU."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Ii-threads ngeNkqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Ii-Threads eziMiselweyo ezivumelekileyo ngenkqubo. QAPHELA: Ukuqala kwi-Cacti 1.2+, le setingi igcinwa kuMqokeleli weDatha, kwaye oku kusisetingi sangaphambili nje. Ukusebenzisa inani eliphezulu xa usebenzisa i-Spine kuya kuphucula ukusebenza. Nangona kunjalo, qinisekisa ukuba unonxibelelwano lwe-MySQL/MariaDB olwaneleyo ukuxhasa le fomyula ilandelayo: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers). Kufuneka kwakhona uqinisekise ukuba unonxibelelwano olongezelelweyo olwaneleyo lonxibelelwano lokungena komsebenzisi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yoqinisekiso"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Uqinisekiso lwaNgaphakathi</i> - I-Cacti ilawula uqinisekiso lwabasebenzisi, nto leyo ekuvumela ukuba wenze abasebenzisi kwaye ubanike amalungelo kwiindawo ezahlukeneyo ngaphakathi kwe-Cacti.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso oluSisiseko lweWebhu</i> - Uqinisekiso lulawulwa yiseva yewebhu. Abasebenzisi bangongezwa okanye benziwe ngokuzenzekelayo xa bengena okokuqala ukuba Umsebenzisi weTempleyithi uchaziwe, kungenjalo kuya kusetyenziswa iimvume zendwendwe ezichaziweyo.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso lwe-LDAP</i> - Luvumela uqinisekiso ngeseva ye-LDAP. Abasebenzisi baya kwenziwa ngokuzenzekelayo xa bengena okokuqala ukuba Umsebenzisi weTempleyithi uchaziwe, kungenjalo kuya kusetyenziswa iimvume zendwendwe ezichaziweyo.  Ukuba imodyuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP ayivulwanga, Uqinisekiso lwe-LDAP aluyi kuvela njengokhetho olunokukhethwa.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso lweDomeyini eNinzi ye-LDAP/AD</i> - Luvumela abalawuli ukuba baxhase amaqela amaninzi ahlukahlukeneyo asuka kwiinkomba ze-LDAP/AD ezahlukeneyo ukuze afikelele kwizibonelelo ze-Cacti.  Kanye njengoQinisekiso lwe-LDAP, imodyuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP iyafuneka ukuze kusetyenziswe le ndlela.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Xhasa iiKhukhi zoQinisekiso"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
