msgstr "I-akhawunti iya kuvulwa ngokuzenzekelayo emva kweli nani lemizuzu.  Nokuba kufakwe iphasiwedi echanekileyo, i-akhawunti ayiyi kuvulwa de kufikelelwe kweli xesha limiselweyo.  Ubuningi bemizuzu eli-1440 (uSuku olu-1)"

#: include/global_settings.php
