msgstr "Usuku olu-1"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi eziQhelekileyo ze-LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "I(ii)seva"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "Uluhlu olwahlulwe ngesithuba lwamagama abamkeli be-DNS okanye iidilesi ze-IP zeeseva ze-LDAP ezisebenzayo. I-Cacti iya kuzama ukusebenzisa iiseva ze-LDAP ukusuka ekhohlo ukuya ekunene ukungqinela umsebenzisi.<br><br>Kwiingeno ze-One-Time Password (OTP/MFA), musa ukusebenzisa uluhlu lweeseva ezininzi olwahlulwe ngesithuba. Xa uqhagamshelwano (bind) lusilela, i-Cacti idlulela kwiseva elandelayo kwaye iphinde iqhagamshele ngeziqinisekiso ezifanayo, kwaye ikhowudi yexesha elinye esele isetyenzisiwe iya kwaliwa. Endaweni yoko, faka igama le-DNS elinye elizinzileyo elikhokelwa sisilungelelanisi somthwalo we-DNS (VIP) ukuze utshintsho lweseva xa isilela lulawulwe ngaphantsi kwe-Cacti kwaye kuqhutywe uqhagamshelwano olunye kuphela lokungqinela."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Iphothi eqhelekileyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "Iphothi ye-TCP yonxibelelwano olungekho-SSL kuquka i-LDAP + TLS. Okumiselweyo ngu-389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "Iphothi ye-SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "Iphothi ye-TCP ye-LDAPS yonxibelelwano lwe-SSL. Okumiselweyo ngu-636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Uguqulelo lweProthokholi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Uguqulelo lweProthokholi lokunxibelelana neseva."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuPhela loNxibelelwano"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Ixesha lokuPhela loNxibelelwano lweNethiwekhi ngemizuzwana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuphelelwa lokubophelela (Bind)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Ixesha lokuPhela le-Bind ngemizuzwana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "Imowudi yokuLungisa iiMpazamo ye-LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Cacti will log extra LDAP information to the Cacti log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Ukuba ikhethiwe, i-Cacti iya kubhala ulwazi olongezelelweyo lwe-LDAP kwilog ye-Cacti ngexesha lemisebenzi ye-Bind noKukhangela."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Uguqulelo oluntsonkothileyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Ufihlo oluxhaswa yiseva. QAPHELA: Xa usebenzisa i-LDAP + TLS kufuneka usebenzise uguqulelo 3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "Iimfuno zeSatifikethi se-TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client."
msgstr "Ngaba i-LDAP kufuneka iqinisekise iiSatifikethi ze-TLS xa zifunyenwe nguMxhasi."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Izidluliselo"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Vula okanye uvale izidluliselo ze-LDAP. Ukuba zivaliwe, kunokunyusa isantya sokukhangela."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Imowudi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user's password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the user's single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Indlela i-cacti eza kuzama ukungqinela ngayo kwiserver ye-LDAP.<blockquote><i>Akukho Kukhangela</i> - Akukho kukhangela kwe-Distinguished Name (DN) okwenzekayo, izama nje ukudibanisa nefomati ye-Distinguished Name (DN) enikiweyo.<br><br><i>Ukukhangela Ngokungaziwa</i> - Izama ukukhangela igama lomsebenzisi kulawulo lwe-LDAP ngokudibanisa ngokungaziwa ukuze ifumane i-Distinguished Name (DN) yomsebenzisi.<br><br><i>Ukukhangela Okuchaziweyo</i> - Izama ukukhangela igama lomsebenzisi kulawulo lwe-LDAP nge-Distinguished Name (DN) Echaziweyo kunye nePhasiwedi Echaziweyo yokudibanisa ukuze ifumane i-Distinguished Name (DN) yomsebenzisi.<br><br><i>Iiphasiwedi Zexesha Elinye (OTP/MFA)</i> - I-Cacti idibanisa iphasiwedi yomsebenzisi kube kanye kuphela, ngexesha lokungqinela kokugqibela. <i>Akukho Kukhangela</i> akwenzi kukhangela kulawulo kwaye kudibanisa ngokuthe ngqo kusetyenziswa itemplate ye-Distinguished Name (DN), ngoko ke kukhuselekile kwi-OTP xa itemplate ye-DN yodwa ichaza umsebenzisi. Xa ukukhangela kulawulo kufuneka ukuze kusonjululwe i-DN, sebenzisa <i>Ukukhangela Okuchaziweyo</i> nge-akhawunti yenkonzo eyodwa (okanye <i>Ukukhangela Ngokungaziwa</i> apho ulawulo lukuvumelayo) ukuze ukukhangela kungaze kusebenzise ikhowudi yomsebenzisi esetyenziswa kanye. Ukufakela i-OTP okuzinzileyo, sebenzisa igama elinye le-DNS load balancer kwibala le-Server(s) kunoluhlu lweeserver ezininzi ezahlulwe ngesithuba, olunokuphinda luzame ukudibanisa ngephasiwedi yexesha elinye esele isetyenzisiwe."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Igama eliKhethekileyo (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Isakhiwo se-\"Gama eliKhethekileyo\" (Distinguished Name), esisebenza kuzo zombini iimilo ze-OpenLDAP kunye ne-Windows AD, sibonelela ngokuguquguquka ekuchazeni isazisi somsebenzisi. Kwi-OpenLDAP, ifomathi ilandela esi sakhiwo: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. I-Windows AD ibonelela ngesinye isakhiwo: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, esiqhelekileyo ukwaziwa ngokuba yi-\"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". Kulo mxholo, u-\"&lt;username&gt;\" umele igama lomsebenzisi elithile elinikwe ngexesha lomyalelo wokungena. Oku kubaluleke ngokukodwa xa usebenza kwimowudi ye-\"Akukho Kukhangela\", okanye xa \"Kufuneka ubuLungu beQela\" kuvuliwe."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Funa Ubulungu Beqela"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Funa ukuba umsebenzisi abe lilungu leqela ukuze angqinelwe. Useto lweqela kufuneka lusetwe ukuze oku kusebenze, ukulwenza lusebenze ngaphandle koseto olufanelekileyo lweqela kuya kubangela ukusilela kokungqinela."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "Useto Lweqela le-LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "IGama eliKhethekileyo (DN) leQela"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "I-Distinguished Name yeqela ekufuneka umsebenzisi abe lilungu lalo."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Uphawu lweLungu leQela"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Oku kubhekisela kuphawu oluthile kulawulo lwe-LDAP olugcina amagama abasebenzisi bamalungu eqela. Kubalulekile ukuqinisekisa ukuba ixabiso lophawu lihambelana nolungiselelo oluchazwe kwi-\"Gama eliKhethekileyo\" okanye ukuba ixabiso lophawu lokwenene liyakwazi ukukhangelwa kusetyenziswa iisetingi ezichazwe kwi-\"Gama eliKhethekileyo\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lweLungu leQela"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Ichaza ukuba ngaba abasebenzisi basebenzisa iGama eliKhethekileyo elipheleleyo okanye iGama lomsebenzisi nje kuphela kuPhawu lweLungu leQela oluchaziweyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Igama Elahlulayo (Distinguished Name)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "Useto Lokukhangela Okuchaziweyo kwe-LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Isiseko sokuKhangela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Isiseko sokukhangela ulawulo lwe-LDAP, njenge-<i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> okanye <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Isihluzo sokuKhangela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Isihluzo sokukhangela esisetyenziselwa ukufumana umsebenzisi kulawulo lwe-LDAP, njengakwi-Windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> okanye kwi-OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>. '&lt;username&gt' sithathelwa indawo ligama lomsebenzisi elinikwe kwisikhombisi sokungena. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Igama Elahlulayo Lokukhangela (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
