#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Izicwangciso zokuHlaziya i-RRD ngokuFuneka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Vumela ukuHlaziya i-RRD ngokuFuneka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Ngaba i-Boost mayivumele uhlaziyo lwe-RRD ngokufuneka kwi-Cacti? Ukuba uyayikhubaza, olu tshintsho aluyi kusebenza de kube emva komjikelo olandelayo we-polling. Xa unabaQokeleli beDatha abaKude, esi sicwangciso kufuneka sivuliwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Isihlaziyi se-RRD kwiNqanaba leNkqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
