msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "I-Boost Mayihlaziye Kangaphi Zonke ii-RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Xa uvumela i-Boost, iifayile zakho ze-RRD zihlaziywa kuphela xa zicelwa ngumsebenzisi, okanye xa eli xesha lidlula."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Inani leeNkqubo ze-Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Inani leenkqubo ze-Boost ezisebenza ngaxeshanye zokucubungula zonke ii-RRD ezikwitafile ye-Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Ubuninzi beeRekhodi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Ukuba itafile yemveliso ye-Boost idlula kobu bungakanani, ngokweerekhodi, uhlaziyo luya kwenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Target Archive Rows Per Range"
msgstr "Imiqolo Ekujoliswe Kuyo Yogcino Ngoluhlu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Isihlaziyi se-Boost sabela ii-ID zeDatha Yendawo ezipheleleyo kuluhlu olulandelelanayo olusondele kweli nani lemiqolo. I-ID yeDatha Yendawo enye ayize yahlulwe, ngoko uluhlu lunokudlula kwinjongo. Yehlisa eli xabiso ukunciphisa imemori yesihlaziyi kunye nexesha lombuzo. Ixabiso elisisiseko ngu-50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Ubude obuphezulu be-Argument"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Xa i-Boost ithumela imiyalelo yohlaziyo kwi-RRDtool, akufuneki idlule kuBude obuphezulu be-Argument benkqubo yokusebenza. Oku kuyahluka ngokwenkqubo yokusebenza kunye nenqanaba le-kernel. Umzekelo: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ ayinasiphelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
