msgstr "Elona nani liphezulu lememori ye-Cacti Poller kunye ne-Boost Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Elona xesha lide lokuSebenza kweSkripthi sokuHlaziya i-RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Ukuba i-poller ye-Boost idlula kweli xesha lokusebenza, isilumkiso siya kufakwa kwilogi ye-Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRDs Queued"
msgstr "Ubuninzi bee-RRD Ezisileleyo Ezikumgca"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of RRD destinations retained for automatic Boost retry. Only the latest complete failed update is retained per destination."
msgstr "Inani eliphezulu leendawo ze-RRD ezigciniweyo ukuze i-Boost iphinde izame ngokuzenzekelayo. Luhlaziyo lwamva nje olupheleleyo olusileleyo kuphela olugcinwayo kwindawo nganye."

