#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Start time for [first|next] mail to take place. All future mailing times will be based upon this start time. A good example would be 2:00am. The time must be in the future.  If a fractional time is used, say 2:00am, it is assumed to be in the future."
msgstr "Ixesha lokuqala ukuze imeyile [yokuqala|elandelayo] ithunyelwe. Onke amaxesha okuthumela kwixesha elizayo aya kusekelwa kweli xesha lokuqala. Umzekelo olungileyo unokuba ngu-2:00am. Ixesha kufuneka libe kwixesha elizayo. Ukuba kusetyenziswa ixesha elingaphelelanga, masithi u-2:00am, kuthathwa ngokuba likwixesha elizayo."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Report Interval"
msgstr "Ixesha eliphakathi kweeNgxelo"

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Defines a Report Frequency relative to the given Mailtime above."
msgstr "Ichaza ukuphinda-phindeka kweNgxelo ngokunxulumene nexesha lemeyile elinikwe ngasentla."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "e.g. 'Week(s)' represents a weekly Reporting Interval."
msgstr "umz. 'Iveki (iiVeki)' imele ixesha lengxelo le veki."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Interval Frequency"
msgstr "Ukuphindaphindeka kwexesha eliphakathi"

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Based upon the Timespan of the Report Interval above, defines the Frequency within that Interval."
msgstr "Ngokusekelwe kwisithuba sexesha seXesha eliphakathi kweeNgxelo ngasentla, ichaza ukuphindaphindeka ngaphakathi kwelo xesha."

#: lib/html_reports.php
msgid "e.g. If the Report Interval is 'Month(s)', then '2' indicates Every '2 Month(s) from the next Mailtime.' Lastly, if using the Month(s) Report Intervals, the 'Day of Week' and the 'Day of Month' are both calculated based upon the Mailtime you specify above."
msgstr "umz. Ukuba iXesha eliphakathi kweeNgxelo yi-'Inyanga (iiNyanga)', ngoko u-'2' ubonisa Rhoqo kwii-'Nyanga ezi-2 ukusuka kwixesha lemeyile elilandelayo.' Okokugqibela, ukuba usebenzisa iXesha eliphakathi kweeNgxelo leeNyanga, 'Usuku lweVeki' kunye 'noSuku lweNyanga' zombini zibalwa ngokusekelwe kwixesha lemeyile olichazileyo ngasentla."

