msgstr "Ngokuzikhethela"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - TimeZone Support"
msgstr "MySQL - Inkxaso yeZowuni Yexesha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Idathabheyisi yakho ye-MySQL TimeZone ayigcwaliswanga.  Nceda ugcwalise le dathabheyisi ngaphambi kokuba uqhubeke."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Iakhawunti yakho yokungena kwidathabheyisi ye-Cacti ayinafikelelo kwidathabheyisi ye-MySQL TimeZone.  Nceda unike iakhawunti yedathabheyisi ye-Cacti ufikelelo lwe-\"select\" kwitheyibhile ye-\"time_zone_name\" kwidathabheyisi ye-\"mysql\", kwaye ugcwalise ulwazi lwe-TimeZone ye-MySQL ngaphambi kokuba uqhubeke."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Iakhawunti yakho yedathabheyisi ye-Cacti inofikelelo kwidathabheyisi ye-MySQL TimeZone kwaye loo dathabheyisi igcwaliswe ngolwazi lwe-TimeZone yehlabathi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "MySQL - Iisetingi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Ezi setingi zokuphucula ukusebenza kwe-MySQL ziya kunceda inkqubo yakho ye-Cacti isebenze ngcono ngaphandle kweengxaki ixesha elide."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi Ezicetyiswayo Zezinto Eziguquguqukayo Zenkqubo ye-MySQL"

