#: user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user's password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the user's single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Indlela i-Cacti eya kuzama ngayo ukungqinisisa kwiseva ye-LDAP.<blockquote><i>Akukho Kukhangela</i> - Akukho kukhangela kweGama eliKhethekileyo (DN) okwenzekayo, zama nje ukudibanisa ngefomathi yeGama eliKhethekileyo (DN) enikiweyo.<br><br><i>Ukukhangela Okungaziwayo</i> - Izama ukukhangela igama lomsebenzisi kulawulo lwe-LDAP ngokudibanisa okungaziwayo ukuze ifumane iGama eliKhethekileyo (DN) lomsebenzisi.<br><br><i>Ukukhangela Okuchaziweyo</i> - Izama ukukhangela igama lomsebenzisi kulawulo lwe-LDAP ngeGama eliKhethekileyo (DN) elichaziweyo kunye neGama eliGqithisiweyo elichaziweyo lokudibanisa ukuze ifumane iGama eliKhethekileyo (DN) lomsebenzisi.<br><br><i>Amagama aGqithisiweyo aSetyenziswa Kanye (OTP/MFA)</i> - I-Cacti idibanisa igama eligqithisiweyo lomsebenzisi kanye kuphela, ngexesha longqinisiso lokugqibela.  I-<i>Akukho Kukhangela</i> ayikhangeli kulawulo kwaye idibanisa ngokuthe ngqo isebenzisa itempleyiti yeGama eliKhethekileyo (DN), ngoko ke ikhuselekile kwi-OTP xa itempleyiti ye-DN yodwa ichonga umsebenzisi.  Xa kufuneka ukukhangela kulawulo ukuze kusonjululwe i-DN, sebenzisa i-<i>Ukukhangela Okuchaziweyo</i> ene-akhawunti yenkonzo eyodwa (okanye i-<i>Ukukhangela Okungaziwayo</i> apho ulawulo luvumela khona) ukuze ukukhangela kungaze kusebenzise ikhowudi esetyenziswa kanye yomsebenzisi.  Ukuze ufumane ukusetyenziswa kwe-OTP okuzinzileyo, sebenzisa igama elinye le-DNS load balancer kwindawo ye-Server(s) endaweni yoluhlu lweeseva ezininzi ezahlulwe ngesithuba, oluya kuphinda luzame ukudibanisa ngegama eligqithisiweyo elisetyenziswa kanye eselisebenzisiwe."

#: user_domains.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."
msgstr "Isiseko sokukhangela sokukhangela ulawulo lwe-LDAP, njenge-<i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> okanye i-<i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."

#: user_domains.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt."
msgstr "Isihluzi sokukhangela esisetyenziswa ukufumana umsebenzisi kuluhlu lwe-LDAP, njengakwi-Windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> okanye kwi-OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>. \"&lt;username&gt\" ithatyathelwa indawo ligama lomsebenzisi elinikwe kwisibizo sokungena."

