#: utilities.php
msgid "Cacti technical support page.  Used by developers and technical support persons to assist with issues in Cacti.  Includes checks for common configuration issues."
msgstr "Iphepha lenkxaso yobuchwepheshe yeCacti.  Lisetyenziswa ngabaphuhlisi kunye nabasebenzi benkxaso yobuchwepheshe ukuncedisa kwimiba yeCacti.  Liquka uhlolo lwemiba eqhelekileyo yoqwalaselo."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Ilogi yeCacti igcina izibalo, iimposiso kunye neminye imiyalezo ngokuxhomekeke kwiisetingi zesixokelelwano.  Olu lwazi lungasetyenziselwa ukuchonga iingxaki ngepoller kunye nosetyenziso."

#: utilities.php
