msgstr "Ivumela abaLawuli ukuba bakhangelisise ilogi yomsebenzisi.  AbaLawuli banokuyihluza kwaye bayithumele ngaphandle ilogi kwakhona."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "ULawulo lweKheshi yePoller"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Le yidatha edluliselwa kwi-poller ngalo lonke ixesha isebenza. Le datha iye iphunyezwe/itolikwe kwaye iziphumo zifakwe kwi-RRDfiles ukwenza iigrafu okanye kwidathabheyisi ukuze ziboniswe."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "IKheshi yoMbuzo weDatha igcina ulwazi oluqokelelwe kwiintlobo zegalelo zoMbuzo weDatha. Amaxabiso asuka kwezi fildi angasetyenziswa kummandla wokubhaliweyo weeGrafu kwiingcaciso, iileyibhile ezithe nkqo, kunye nee-GPRINT kwakunye nakwii-CDEF."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Yakha kwakhona iKheshi yePoller"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "IKheshi yePoller iya kuphinda yenziwe ukuba ukhetha olu khetho. Sebenzisa olu khetho kuphela xa kukho ukuwohloka kwedathabheyisi ukuba uhlangabezana nemiba emva kokuwohloka kwaye sele uqhube izixhobo zokulungisa idathabheyisi.  Kungenjalo, ukuba unengxaki ngeSixhobo esithile, vele ugcine kwakhona eso Sixhobo ukuze wakhe kwakhona iKheshi yaso yePoller.  Kukho nokulingana kwe-interface yomgca womyalelo kulo myalelo okucetyiswayo kwiinkqubo ezinkulu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "QAPHELA: Kwiinkqubo ezinkulu, lo myalelo ungathatha imizuzu emininzi ukuya kwiiyure ukugqiba ngoko akufanele uqhutywe ukusuka kwi-UI yeCacti.  Ungavele uqhube 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' kumgca womyalelo ukuze ufumane ulwazi olungakumbi."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Yakha kwakhona iKheshi yeZibonelelo"

#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Xa usebenzisa abaQokeleli beDatha abaninzi kwiCacti, iCacti iya kuzama ukugcina imo yeefayile ezingundoqo kubo bonke abaQokeleli beDatha.  Oku kuquka zonke iifayile ezingundoqo zewebhusayithi kunye nezixhobo zokongeza ezingahambelani nokufakela.  Xa unyanzelisa ukwakhiwa kwakhona kweKheshi yeZibonelelo, iCacti iya kucima iKheshi yeZibonelelo yasekhaya, kwaye emva koko iyakhe kwakhona ekuqaleni okulandelayo okucwangcisiweyo kwe-poller.  Oku kuya kubangela ukuba bonke abaQokeleli beDatha abaKude baphinde bahlole iifayile zabo zewebhusayithi kunye neephlagini ukuze zilungelelane."

